
@ShopApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7001
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..-dKLqFL_Jl_KGQdV2iZL3HR2pwDmS6ebr4SjOirW5rM

### Public: list items
GET {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/items
Accept: application/json

### Protected without a token: expect 401
GET {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json


### My orders
GET {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Place an order: prices come from the server
POST {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "lines": [
    { "itemId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "itemId": 2, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Too many: expect 400 with a stock message
POST {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "lines": [
    { "itemId": 3, "quantity": 999 }
  ]
}

### One order (404 if it belongs to another user)
GET {{ShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
